## Phased Build Plan

### Phase 1 — Foundation (6 weeks) ← **START HERE**
> RAG + Reactive Bot + Flat Persona

**Deliverables:**
1. ✅ FastAPI server with `/api/chat` SSE endpoint
2. ✅ LangGraph orchestration (linear: validate → fetch context → RAG → generate → stream)
3. ✅ RAG pipeline: query expansion (HyDE) → embed → search (pgvector) → rerank (Cohere) → inject
4. ✅ Working memory with token budgeting (10,600 tok / 32k ctx)
5. ✅ Basic persona (flat JSON from profile table)
6. ✅ Basic compliance: SEBI disclaimer injection + blocked-word list
7. ✅ Rate limiting (60s window)
8. ✅ Circuit breaker (Claude → Haiku → static FAQ)
9. ✅ Frontend integration: update `ChatbotWidget.tsx` to call FastAPI with SSE
10. ✅ Ingestion pipeline: manual article ingestion from your existing CMS

### Phase 2 — Intelligence (3 months)
> Reranker + AA + Proactive Types A/C

- Cross-encoder reranker (Cohere API)
- Account Aggregator integration (Setu/Finvu)
- Proactive nudge engine (article→goal, calculator use triggers)
- Session Context Bridge (48h behavior window)
- Adaptive nudge thresholds

### Phase 3 — Safety (6 months)
> Behavioral Risk + Literacy + Compliance Gate

- Full hallucination guard (claim extraction + chunk provenance)
- DPDPA granular consent checker
- Escalation detector (distress keywords, complexity matching)
- Persona enrichment (literacy calibration, behavioral risk scoring)
- Goal classification (vague → committed spectrum)

### Phase 4 — Scale (12 months)
> Self-hosted Reranker + Granular Consent + Adaptive Threshold

- Self-hosted MiniLM reranker
- DPDPA granular field-level consent
- Adaptive nudge thresholds per user segment
- Pinecone migration for 1M+ chunks
- A/B test cohort tracking for nudges

